"author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_06_data_server_refresh_reuse_grace", "label": "Refresh reuse grace 60 s (REFRESH_REUSE_GRACE_SEC) while new token unused: same new token returned (derived by HMAC, not stored)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/spec/06-data-server.md", "source_location": "L54", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A response lost on an unstable network must not disconnect the device."}, {"id": "docs_spec_06_data_server_recovery_key_replace", "label": "Recovery key replacement (POST /v1/auth/recovery-key) with password; started recoveries cancelled; security events log (GET /v1/me/security-events)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec/06-data-server.md", "source_location": "L55", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_06_data_server_password_change_revocation", "label": "Password change revokes other devices; recovery revokes all (new session)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec/06-data-server.md", "source_location": "L56", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_06_data_server_session_device_id", "label": "Session carries deviceId; signup and recovery/finish accept optional deviceName", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec/06-data-server.md", "source_location": "L57", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_06_data_server_seq_ordering", "label": "seq assigned in transaction under document row lock \u2014 strictly increasing, gapless; live delivery in seq order", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec/06-data-server.md", "source_location": "L61", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_06_data_server_clientmsgid_dedup", "label": "Repeated push with same clientMsgId from same device gives ack with previous seq", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec/06-data-server.md", "source_location": "L62", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_06_data_server_device_id_scheme", "label": "deviceId scheme: user device from token, guest:<22-char hash>, agent:<grantId> (\u226464 chars)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec/06-data-server.md", "source_location": "L63", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_06_data_server_sync_errors", "label": "Sync errors: bad_request (ref = clientMsgId), protocol_mismatch only for unsupported version, doc_not_found on deletion", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec/06-data-server.md", "source_location": "L64", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_06_data_server_sync_limits", "label": "Sync limits: update 2 MB, snapshot 50 MB, awareness 64 KB (subscribed docs only), 100 msg/s per connection (burst \u00d75)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec/06-data-server.md", "source_location": "L65", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_06_data_server_snapshots_history_r_05", "label": "Snapshots, compaction and version history (R-05): client snapshots at >500 updates / >1 MB; server snapshots for agent notebooks; versions = snapshots (GET /v1/docs/:id/versions)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec/06-data-server.md", "source_location": "L70", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_06_data_server_snapshot_on_close", "label": "Snapshot on leaving a document after \u226530 edits since last snapshot (\u041f\u0420\u0415\u0414\u041b\u041e\u0416\u0415\u041d\u041e web-app)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/spec/06-data-server.md", "source_location": "L70", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Otherwise history versions are too sparse."}, {"id": "docs_spec_06_data_server_history_retention_policy", "label": "History retention: covered updates kept 7 days; snapshots all for 7 days, daily to 30 d, weekly to a year, then monthly (HISTORY_*)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec/06-data-server.md", "source_location": "L72", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_06_data_server_first_sync_batching", "label": "First sync: subscribe batched 200 docs per query (\u2264100 updates), backpressure at 4 MB unread; ~1.2 s for 10 000 notes (spec/11 goal \u00abup to a minute\u00bb)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec/06-data-server.md", "source_location": "L74", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_06_data_server_subscribe_snapshot_tail", "label": "subscribe with since < last snapshot seq always sends snapshot + tail (sync-protocol \u00a75, 2026-10-26)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/spec/06-data-server.md", "source_location": "L75", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A device unable to read some updates (wrong key from a client bug) recovers from a later healthy snapshot."}, {"id": "docs_spec_06_data_server_notebook_share_scope", "label": "Sharing a notebook grants its index and all notes, including later ones", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec/06-data-server.md", "source_location": "L79", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_06_data_server_guest_token", "label": "Guest token lives as long as the link; revocation disconnects guests; can read and (edit) upload share attachments, never delete; deleting note/notebook revokes links", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec/06-data-server.md", "source_location": "L80", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_06_data_server_agents_rls", "label": "Agents (D-30): @datascratch/agents; each data request in transaction under role ds_agent with Row-Level Security per grant; notebook key decrypted only inside", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/spec/06-data-server.md", "source_location": "L86", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Even an erroneous query in code cannot read or write someone else's notebook."}, {"id": "docs_spec_06_data_server_private_mode_revokes_agents", "label": "Switching notebook to private revokes agent access immediately; deleted notebook removed from grants", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec/06-data-server.md", "source_location": "L87", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_06_data_server_oauth_web_session", "label": "OAuth consent screen via web-session cookie (POST /v1/auth/web-session)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec/06-data-server.md", "source_location": "L88", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_06_data_server_pg_boss_jobs", "label": "pg-boss background jobs: doc-compact (after snapshot), cleanup (hourly), history-sweep (daily retention)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec/06-data-server.md", "source_location": "L92", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_06_data_server_metrics_endpoint", "label": "Prometheus GET /metrics gated by METRICS_TOKEN bearer (HTTP, sync, updates, connections, pool, memory)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec/06-data-server.md", "source_location": "L96", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_06_data_server_move_note", "label": "Move note between notebooks: PATCH /v1/docs/:id { notebookId }; history, attachments, key unchanged (client rewraps); old share guests lose note; agent RLS recomputed", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec/06-data-server.md", "source_location": "L100", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_06_data_server_auto_deploy", "label": "Automatic deploy (infra/DEPLOY.md): GHCR images, SSH, idempotent server prep, migrations \u2192 compose up \u2192 HTTPS check, rollback; one domain or <ip>.sslip.io", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec/06-data-server.md", "source_location": "L104", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_06_data_server_ghcr_images_no_docker_hub", "label": "All images incl. PostgreSQL in GHCR; Docker from Ubuntu repo, no Docker Hub (unreachable from Russia)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/spec/06-data-server.md", "source_location": "L104", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_06_data_server_deploy_memory_budget", "label": "Memory budget on 2 CPU / 4 GB VPS: PostgreSQL 1 GB, server 1 GB, Caddy 256 MB; CI test on simulated VPS", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec/06-data-server.md", "source_location": "L104", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_06_data_server_shared_server_deploy", "label": "Deploy on shared server: inspect (read-only), DEPLOY_ENABLED guard, Sinhron Caddy integration (edge network), behind-proxy 127.0.0.1:8480 (DS_NGINX_AUTO), DEPLOY_MODE, smaller limits", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/spec/06-data-server.md", "source_location": "L106", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_spec_06_data_server_trash", "label": "Trash: trashedAt encrypted in notebook index; after 30 days client calls DELETE /v1/docs/:i